---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="简历" currentPath="/resume">
  <slot name="head">
    <style>
      .page { padding: 2.5rem 0; }
      .page-head { margin-bottom: 2rem; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent); padding-bottom: 1rem; }
      .page-head h1 { margin-bottom: 0.1rem; }
      .page-head .sub { color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 1rem; }
      .page-head .meta-line { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.82rem; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; margin-top: 0.2rem; }

      .info-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: 0.3rem 1.5rem; font-size: 0.9rem; }
      .info-grid .label { color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 500; white-space: nowrap; }
      .info-grid .value { color: var(--text-primary); }

      .skill-area { margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
      .skill-area .cat { font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 0.3rem; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; }
      .skill-area .items { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.35rem; }

      .project-block { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding: 1rem 1.25rem; background: var(--bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--border-light); border-radius: var(--radius-md); }
      .project-block h3 { font-size: 1rem; margin: 0 0 0.15rem; }
      .project-block .tech-stack { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--accent); font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
      .project-block p { font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
      .project-block ul { font-size: 0.84rem; color: var(--text-secondary); padding-left: 1.2rem; }
      .project-block ul li { margin-bottom: 0.15rem; }

      .eval-box {
        font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.8;
        padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-muted), var(--bg-card));
        border: 1px solid var(--border-light); border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      }
    </style>
  </slot>

  <div class="page fade-in">
    <div class="content-container">

      <div class="page-head">
        <h1>杨常卿</h1>
        <div class="sub">嵌入式软件工程师 · 求职意向</div>
        <div class="meta-line">2029 届硕士 · 黑龙江大学 · 控制工程</div>
      </div>

      <div class="page-section">
        <h2>🎓 教育背景</h2>
        <div class="info-grid">
          <span class="label">2026.09 – 2029.06</span>
          <span class="value">黑龙江大学 · 控制工程 · 硕士</span>
          <span class="label">2022.09 – 2026.06</span>
          <span class="value">黑龙江大学 · 自动化 · 本科</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="page-section">
        <h2>🔧 专业技能</h2>
        <div class="skill-area">
          <div class="cat">编程语言</div>
          <div class="items">
            <span class="tag">C（熟练）</span>
            <span class="tag">C++（基础）</span>
            <span class="tag">Python（基础）</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="skill-area">
          <div class="cat">MCU 开发</div>
          <div class="items">
            <span class="tag">STM32（标准外设库）</span>
            <span class="tag">GPIO</span>
            <span class="tag">UART</span>
            <span class="tag">SysTick</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="skill-area">
          <div class="cat">工具链</div>
          <div class="items">
            <span class="tag">Keil MDK</span>
            <span class="tag">Git</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="skill-area">
          <div class="cat">工程习惯</div>
          <div class="items">
            <span class="tag">模块化分层架构</span>
            <span class="tag">开发文档与知识沉淀</span>
            <span class="tag">非阻塞编程思维</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="page-section">
        <h2>🚀 项目经历</h2>
        <div class="project-block">
          <h3>串口命令控制 LED 系统</h3>
          <div class="tech-stack">C · STM32F407 · Keil MDK · 标准外设库</div>
          <p>基于 STM32F407 实现的非阻塞 LED 控制系统，支持通过串口命令实时控制 LED 颜色与模式。</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>架构设计：</strong>BSP/App/User 三层模块化架构，各层职责明确，模块可复用</li>
            <li><strong>中断接收：</strong>UART 中断（RXNE）+ 环形缓冲区 FIFO，ISR 只存不处理，主循环消费，零丢数据</li>
            <li><strong>系统时钟：</strong>SysTick 1ms 中断，提供 Tick_Get / Tick_Elapsed 非阻塞延时 API，实现多任务并行调度</li>
            <li><strong>命令解析：</strong>字符串命令引擎（strncmp + sscanf），支持 8+ 种颜色控制及 help/status 指令</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="page-section">
        <h2>🧭 自我评价</h2>
        <div class="eval-box">
          目标嵌入式软件工程师。注重工程实践与知识沉淀，每完成一个模块均配套设计文档与开发日志，
          确保可追溯可复用。具备独立驱动开发和问题排查能力，善于从底层理解硬件行为。
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
